Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the Database Contents License (DbCL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

Sources:
- Gyms outside Taiwan, and coordinates for gyms in Yilan County: © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0 (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright).
- Coordinates for other gyms in Taiwan: address-point open data from Taiwan's city and county governments, used under the Open Government Data License, version 1.0 (https://data.gov.tw/license).

If you use, adapt or distribute this database (including adapted versions), keep the attribution above and offer it under ODbL 1.0. See docs/gyms.md for how it is built.
